return ['domain'=>'zinn-migrate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-migrate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:02+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-01T20:49:02+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Migrate'=>'Zinn® Migrate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-migrate','Packages this WordPress site — files and database — into one archive that Zinn Digital® can pull in, for hosts we cannot reach any other way. Install it on the site you are LEAVING, press one button, and paste the link into your Zinn® migration.'=>'Wuxuu boggan WordPress — faylasha iyo xog-ururinta — ku xidhayaa hal kayd oo Zinn Digital® soo jiidan karto, marka la eego martigeliyeyaasha aynaan si kale ku gaadhi karin. Ku rakib bogga aad KA TAGAYSO, riix hal badhan, oo ku dheji xidhiidhka gudaha socdaalkaaga Zinn®.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Move this site to Zinn®'=>'U rar barkan boggan Zinn®','Move to Zinn®'=>'U rar Zinn®','You do not have permission to do this.'=>'Uma lihid ogolaansho inaad tan samayso.','This packages everything on this site — its files and its database — into one archive, and gives you a private link to it. Paste that link into your migration on Zinn® and we will pull the site across. Nothing here is sent anywhere until you choose to share the link.'=>'Tani waxay dhammaan waxyaabaha ku jira goobtan — faylasheeda iyo xogteeda kaydsan — ku xidhaysaa hal kayd, waxayna ku siinaysaa xidhiidhin gaar ah oo ku socota. Ku dheji xidhiidhintaas wareejintaada ku taal Zinn® annaguna waannu soo wareejin doonnaa goobta. Waxba halkan yaal meelna looma diro ilaa aad adigu doorato inaad la wadaagto xidhiidhinta.','You may not need this. If your old host gives you FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk or DirectAdmin, Zinn® can fetch the site directly with those details and you can skip this plugin entirely — it is faster and there is nothing left behind afterwards. Use this when none of those are available to you.'=>'Waxaa laga yaabaa inaadan tan u baahnayn. Haddii martigeliyahaagii hore uu ku siiyo FTP, SSH, cPanel, Plesk ama DirectAdmin, Zinn® ayaa si toos ah u soo qaadan kara goobta iyadoo la adeegsanayo xogtaas, waadna ka boodi kartaa plugin-kan gebi ahaanba — way ka dhakhso badan tahay, mana jiraan wax ka hara kadib. Isticmaal tan marka midkoodna aadan heli karin.','Room on this server'=>'Booska ku jira serferkan','This server will not tell us how much disk space is free, so we cannot check for you. The package needs roughly %s. If you are not sure there is that much room, ask your host before you build it — a server that runs out of space mid-way takes the site down.'=>'Server-kani nooma sheegayo inta boos ee disk-ga xorta ah, markaa anagu kuuma hubin karno. Xirmadu waxay u baahan tahay qiyaastii %s. Haddii aadan hubin in booskaas le\'eg uu jiro, weydii shirkaddaada martigelinta ka hor inta aadan dhisin — server-ka ay boosku kaga dhammaato bartamaha howsha wuxuu gooyaa shaqada bogga.','The package needs roughly %1$s and this server has %2$s free.'=>'Xirmadu waxay u baahan tahay qiyaastii %1$s adeegahanina wuxuu leeyahay %2$s oo bannaan.','Build the package'=>'Dhis xirmada','Building…'=>'Dhisaya…','Now packaging: %1$s. %2$s files so far, %3$s written.'=>'Hadda baakidhaynaya: %1$s. Ilaa hadda %2$s fayl, %3$s la qoray.','your files'=>'Faylashaada','your database'=>'Xog-ururintaada','Continue'=>'Sii wad','Cancel and delete'=>'Kansal garee oo tirtir','Your package is ready'=>'Xirmadaadu waa diyaar','Copy this link and paste it into your migration on Zinn®:'=>'Koobiye xiriirintan oo ku dheji guuritaankaaga Zinn®:','Size: %s.'=>'Baaxadda: %s.','Treat this link like a password. Anyone who has it can download your whole site, including your database. We delete the package automatically 24 hours after it was built — delete it yourself as soon as your migration has finished.'=>'Ula dhaqan xiriirintan sida erayga sirta ah. Qof kasta oo haysta waxa uu soo dejisan karaa goobtaada oo dhan, oo ay ku jirto keydkaaga xogta. Waxaan xirmada tirtirnaa si toos ah 24 saacadood ka dib marka la dhiso — adigu iska tirtir isla marka uu guuritaankaagu dhammaado.','Delete the package now'=>'Tirtir xirmada hadda','Build it again'=>'Mar kale dhis','This server does not have PHP’s ZipArchive extension, so we cannot build a package here. Ask your host to enable it, or use the migration form on Zinn® with your FTP or SSH details instead.'=>'Serfarkani ma laha kordhinta ZipArchive ee PHP, sidaa darteed halkan kuma dhisi karno xidhmo. Weydii adeeg-bixiyahaaga inuu awood siiyo, ama taa beddelkeeda isticmaal foomka wareejinta ee Zinn® adiga oo adeegsanaya faahfaahintaada FTP ama SSH.','We could not create a folder inside your uploads directory, so there is nowhere to write the package. Check that wp-content/uploads is writable.'=>'Ma aanan awoodin inaan gal ka dhex abuurno galkaaga waxyaabaha la soo geliyo, sidaas darteed ma jirto meel xirmada lagu qoro. Hubi in wp-content/uploads uu yahay mid wax lagu qori karo.','There is no package being built. Start one first.'=>'Ma jiro baakidh la dhisayo. Marka hore mid billow.','We could not open the package file for writing.'=>'Waan furi weynay faylka xirmada si wax loogu qoro.','We could not write the database export.'=>'Ma aanan awoodin inaan qorno dhoofinta xog-ururinta.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaal iyo adeegyo','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri buug-tilmaameedka isticmaalaha %s','Hide this'=>'Qari kan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kaydinta maalinlaha ah, wareejin bilaash ah iyo qaybta koontaroolka oo loo dhisay dadka maamula wax ka badan hal degel.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi goobo dhisan, xayndaabyo iyo meelaynta xiriiriyaha, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinacba ay ku qancaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — shaqaalayso dad shaqadoodu tahay tan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqayada xorta ah ee caalamiga ah: baadh in ka badan 10,000 oo adeegyo diyaar ah oo ka socda qorayaasha, nashqadeeyayaasha, horumariyeyaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama dheji mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalabyo soo gudbiyaan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraalada nooca cusub ee Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® ma soo saarin xiriirinta soo dejinta ee cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in boggani gaari karo goobta Zinn®, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta lagama soo dejisan karin adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® (%s). Fadlan isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo ka dib.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta la soo dejiyay kuma guulaysan hubinta saxnimadeeda mana la rakibin.']];